{% liquid
  assign hero_image = 'images/2._2do_Banner_Home_1296x.webp' | asset_url
  assign klaviyo_form_id = 'VNXeGV'
%}

<script>
  document.documentElement.classList.add('pioneers-motion-enabled');
</script>

<article class="pioneers-article" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/BlogPosting">
  <section
    class="pioneers-article__hero"
    style="background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,0,0,.86) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,.66) 36%, rgba(0,0,0,.2) 70%), url('{{ hero_image }}');"
  >
    <div class="pioneers-article__hero-inner">
      <div class="pioneers-article__hero-copy">
        <h1 class="pioneers-article__title ff-heading">THE FIRST 100.</h1>
        <div class="pioneers-article__intro ff-body">
          <p>Not a membership.</p>
          <p>Not a loyalty program.</p>
          <p>A small group that enters the brand before it becomes widely known.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pioneers-article__details">
    <div class="pioneers-article__details-inner">
      <div class="pioneers-article__steps pioneers-article__steps--left pioneers-reveal">
        <div class="pioneers-step pioneers-step--01">
          <span class="pioneers-step__number">01</span>
          <div>
            <p>EZENTI Pioneers is limited to individuals who have already shown commitment to the brand.</p>
            <p>Entry is not open to everyone and access is intentionally restricted.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pioneers-step pioneers-step--03">
          <span class="pioneers-step__number">03</span>
          <div>
            <h2>ENTRY</h2>
            <p>To be considered for EZENTI Pioneers:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>A customer must have completed a minimum of three purchases.</li>
              <li>Access is limited to the first 100 individuals who meet this requirement.</li>
              <li>Admission is reviewed and approved manually.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Once accepted, each individual becomes part of the first circle around the brand.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pioneers-step pioneers-step--05">
          <span class="pioneers-step__number">05</span>
          <div>
            <h2>CORE PIONEERS</h2>
            <p>#001 - #050</p>
            <p>The first half of the circle receives the highest level of access within the program.</p>
            <p>Benefits include:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Early access to EZENTI drops.</li>
              <li>Priority access to limited pieces before public availability.</li>
              <li>Private product previews and internal surveys.</li>
              <li>Additional brand updates and selected privileges.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pioneers-article__steps pioneers-article__steps--right pioneers-reveal">
        <div class="pioneers-step pioneers-step--02">
          <span class="pioneers-step__number">02</span>
          <div>
            <h2>IDENTITY</h2>
            <p>Every Pioneer receives a unique identifier, assigned sequentially.</p>
            <p class="pioneers-step__identity">#001 - #100</p>
            <p>This number is permanent and defines the Pioneer's position within the group.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pioneers-step pioneers-step--04">
          <span class="pioneers-step__number">04</span>
          <div>
            <h2>PIONEERS</h2>
            <p>#051 - #100</p>
            <p>The second half of the circle receives priority access and remains part of the brand's early community.</p>
            <p>Benefits include:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Early access to Core Collection releases.</li>
              <li>Priority during launch windows.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pioneers-step pioneers-step--06">
          <span class="pioneers-step__number">06</span>
          <div>
            <h2>WITHIN THE FIRST 100</h2>
            <p>Among the first 100 Pioneers, a smaller group may unlock additional access based on continued proximity to the brand.</p>
            <p>Access is not guaranteed. Selection is determined by continued engagement with the brand.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pioneers-step pioneers-step--07">
          <span class="pioneers-step__number">07</span>
          <div>
            <h2>A LIMITED CIRCLE</h2>
            <p>EZENTI Pioneers will never exceed 100 individuals.</p>
            <p>Once the circle is complete, it closes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="pioneers-article__form-column pioneers-reveal">
        <div class="pioneers-article__form-panel">
          <h2>JOIN THE PIONEER LIST</h2>
          <p>Be the first to know when access becomes available.</p>
          <div class="klaviyo-form-{{ klaviyo_form_id }}"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="pioneers-article__cta-panel">
          <div class="pioneers-article__divider">
            <span></span>
            <p>OR</p>
            <span></span>
          </div>

          <h2>SHOP NOW</h2>
          <p>Explore the collection.</p>
          <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}" class="pioneers-article__button">SHOP NOW</a>
        </div>

        <div class="pioneers-article__note">
          <h2>PIONEER PROGRAM</h2>
          <p>Only 100 positions will exist.</p>
          <p>Built for the early ones.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</article>

<style>
  .pioneers-article {
    background: #0b0b0b;
    color: #f2f2f2;
  }

  .pioneers-article__hero {
    min-height: clamp(320px, 48vw, 560px);
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center right;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
  }

  .pioneers-article__hero-inner,
  .pioneers-article__details-inner {
    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .pioneers-article__hero-inner {
    min-height: inherit;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .pioneers-article__hero-copy {
    max-width: 430px;
  }

  .pioneers-motion-enabled .pioneers-article__hero-copy {
    animation: pioneersHeroIn 1050ms cubic-bezier(.16, 1, .3, 1) both;
  }

  .pioneers-article__title {
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 92px);
    line-height: .9;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .pioneers-article__intro {
    max-width: 310px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.86);
  }

  .pioneers-article__intro p {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }

  .pioneers-article__details {
    padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 56px) 0 clamp(44px, 7vw, 80px);
  }

  .pioneers-article__details-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(280px, 360px);
    gap: clamp(28px, 5vw, 58px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .pioneers-article__steps {
    display: grid;
    gap: 34px;
  }

  .pioneers-motion-enabled .pioneers-reveal {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(58px);
    transition:
      opacity 900ms cubic-bezier(.16, 1, .3, 1),
      transform 900ms cubic-bezier(.16, 1, .3, 1);
  }

  .pioneers-motion-enabled .pioneers-article__steps--left {
    transition-delay: 90ms;
  }

  .pioneers-motion-enabled .pioneers-article__steps--right {
    transition-delay: 260ms;
  }

  .pioneers-step {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 34px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 18px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.72);
  }

  .pioneers-step__number {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.72);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.26);
    padding-bottom: 5px;
    height: max-content;
  }

  .pioneers-step h2,
  .pioneers-article__form-panel h2,
  .pioneers-article__cta-panel h2,
  .pioneers-article__note h2 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: #f5f5f5;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .pioneers-step p,
  .pioneers-step li,
  .pioneers-article__form-panel p,
  .pioneers-article__cta-panel p,
  .pioneers-article__note p {
    margin: 0 0 9px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .pioneers-step ul {
    margin: 8px 0 12px;
    padding-left: 18px;
  }

  .pioneers-step__identity {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px) !important;
    line-height: 1 !important;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    margin: 12px 0 14px !important;
  }

  .pioneers-article__form-column {
    display: grid;
    gap: 20px;
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
    padding-left: clamp(24px, 4vw, 44px);
  }

  .pioneers-motion-enabled .pioneers-article__form-column {
    transition-delay: 430ms;
  }

  .pioneers-article__form-panel,
  .pioneers-article__cta-panel,
  .pioneers-article__note {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);
    padding: 26px;
  }

  .pioneers-article__form-panel {
    background: #101010;
  }

  .pioneers-article__divider {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.58);
  }

  .pioneers-article__divider span {
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.16);
  }

  .pioneers-article__divider p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .pioneers-article__button {
    display: inline-flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 12px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.45);
    color: #ffffff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .pioneers-article__note {
    text-align: center;
    background: #111111;
  }

  @keyframes pioneersHeroIn {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateX(-72px);
    }

    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateX(0);
    }
  }

  .pioneers-motion-enabled .pioneers-reveal.is-visible {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .pioneers-article__hero-copy,
    .pioneers-article__steps,
    .pioneers-article__form-column {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
      animation: none;
      transition: none;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 959px) {
    .pioneers-article__hero-inner,
    .pioneers-article__details-inner {
      width: min(100% - 28px, 680px);
    }

    .pioneers-article__hero {
      background-position: center;
    }

    .pioneers-article__details-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .pioneers-article__steps {
      display: contents;
    }

    .pioneers-step--01 {
      order: 1;
    }

    .pioneers-step--02 {
      order: 2;
    }

    .pioneers-step--03 {
      order: 3;
    }

    .pioneers-step--04 {
      order: 4;
    }

    .pioneers-step--05 {
      order: 5;
    }

    .pioneers-step--06 {
      order: 6;
    }

    .pioneers-step--07 {
      order: 7;
    }

    .pioneers-article__form-column {
      border-left: 0;
      padding-left: 0;
      order: 8;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  (function () {
    function initPioneersReveal() {
      var reveals = document.querySelectorAll('.pioneers-reveal');

      if (!reveals.length) return;

      if (!('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {
        reveals.forEach(function (element) {
          element.classList.add('is-visible');
        });
        return;
      }

      var observer = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {
        entries.forEach(function (entry) {
          if (entry.isIntersecting) {
            entry.target.classList.add('is-visible');
            observer.unobserve(entry.target);
          }
        });
      }, {
        threshold: 0.12,
        rootMargin: '0px 0px -12% 0px'
      });

      reveals.forEach(function (element) {
        observer.observe(element);
      });
    }

    if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
      document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', initPioneersReveal);
    } else {
      window.requestAnimationFrame(initPioneersReveal);
    }
  })();
</script>
